    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "3b5iv",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "What Is Swedish Massage?",
            "decorations": [
              {
                "type": "ITALIC",
                "italicData": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "8e6ia",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "7nnd1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Swedish massage, also called classic massage, uses a range of hands-on techniques, often with an emphasis on comfort and relaxation. Your therapist can adapt the pace and pressure to your preferences.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "e3bo8",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "3rcav",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "The Names of Techniques and Movements Involved in Swedish Massage",
            "decorations": [
              {
                "type": "ITALIC",
                "italicData": true
              },
              {
                "type": "UNDERLINE"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "96f9",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "7jl16",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "Swedish massage is renowned for its five key techniques, each with a distinctive name and purpose:",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "ci54b",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "b05hs",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "1. Effleurage: Long, gliding strokes using the palms or fingers, often used to begin a session and establish comfortable pressure.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "7rnke",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "sg3l",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "2. Petrissage: Kneading, lifting or rolling movements applied to soft tissue with pressure adapted to the person.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "1qcjo",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "9jst9",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "3. Friction: Focused rubbing movements applied to a particular area. Pressure should remain appropriate to your comfort and needs; it is not a promise to break down adhesions.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "bg10i",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "f4odb",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "4. Tapotement: Also known as percussion, tapotement includes rhythmic tapping or chopping motions using the edge of the hand or fingertips. It stimulates the muscles, invigorates the body, and provides a sense of energy and vitality.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "75hcs",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "chtl2",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "5. Vibration: Small shaking or oscillating movements that may be included according to your preferences.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "evi0g",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "2h9v2",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "Practical Applications and Benefits of Swedish Massage Therapy",
            "decorations": [
              {
                "type": "ITALIC",
                "italicData": true
              },
              {
                "type": "UNDERLINE"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "3c0sv",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "ckvnt",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "1. Stress Reduction: The gentle, rhythmic strokes of Swedish massage can help reduce stress and anxiety, providing a much-needed escape from the demands of parenthood.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "2edij",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "dfmro",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "2. Muscle Comfort: Tell your therapist about areas of tension, such as the neck, shoulders or back, so the session can focus on a useful goal.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "8s25g",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "d63p1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "3. Time to Unwind: A quieter pace and a comfortable setting can make the appointment a welcome pause in a busy week.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "5ej1a",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "1lrkh",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "4. Personalized Pressure: You can ask for lighter or firmer work, changes in positioning or an adjustment to any technique.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "cfbht",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "3gs0j",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "5. A Moment for Yourself: Choose a session that gives you space to rest and attend to your own comfort.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "7i5fd",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "9n9l2",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "A Swedish massage can be a practical way to make room for rest. Share your goals, choose comfortable pressure and let the session fit your needs rather than adding another performance expectation to a busy day.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {
        "textStyle": {
          "textAlignment": "AUTO"
        },
        "indentation": 0
      }
    },
